        "content": "## ⚡ Facebook Video & Reels Spoken Transcript Extractor for Content Repurposing\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nExtract clean spoken word transcripts from high-performing Facebook Reels and video ads to feed into AI scriptwriters.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/facebook-video-reels-ai-transcript-extractor`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/facebook-video-reels-ai-transcript-extractor) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Facebook Video & Reel AI Transcript Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
